{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32358","headline":"题西平王旧赐屏风 · 温庭筠","name":"题西平王旧赐屏风","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾向金扉玉砌来，百花鲜湿隔尘埃。\n披香殿下樱桃熟，结绮楼前芍药开。\n朱鹭已随新卤簿，黄鹂犹湿旧池台。\n世间刚有东流水，一送恩波更不廻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32358.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32358","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}